Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.62,0:04:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll save you.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.32,0:05:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.98,0:07:09.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH] Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.01,0:09:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.06,0:12:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.05,0:14:49.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.89,0:14:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whenever you're ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.39,0:14:52.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aim for the dead center!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.67,0:15:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.57,0:15:09.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.48,0:15:16.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.28,0:15:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.64,0:15:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A cop!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.87,0:15:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.09,0:15:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.92,0:15:33.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.90,0:15:40.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.54,0:15:42.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE K] There's an alien\Nship in the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.38,0:17:39.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Galaxy Impact!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.29,0:17:50.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Impact!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.09,0:19:44.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all right, Koby?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.95,0:20:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B] Captain Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.71,0:20:15.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.13,0:20:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY] Tashigi!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.87,0:20:21.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even people who are from\NSWORD are here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.28,0:20:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We tried, Vice Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:31.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's unfair!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.50,0:20:35.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...something?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.82,0:20:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.11,0:20:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hibari!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.54,0:20:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hibari!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.46,0:21:03.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GARP] Kuzan.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.50,0:21:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Kuzan!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.34,0:21:52.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Akainu stood triumphant.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.16,0:23:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ze-ze-ze-ze-ze-
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.02,0:24:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.15,0:24:07.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's ready for more?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.42,0:27:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, buddy!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.00,0:27:58.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.34,0:30:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:32.20,0:32:33.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 50,0:32:53.12,0:32:55.00,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,On the coast\Nof Winter Island...
Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.55,0:33:14.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zee!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:17.28,0:33:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zee!
