Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.36,0:01:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE E] Aw,\Nyeah! If he's free,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.63,0:01:46.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Commodore can't stop\Nus from goin' after him.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.06,0:01:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be set for life if we\Ncan catch him ourselves!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.72,0:01:50.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE F] Then what\Nthe hell are we waitin' for?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.40,0:01:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! He's already got a bounty,\Nso we'll be good to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.25,0:01:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is take\Nhis head to Cross Guild!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.59,0:01:59.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah. I bought odds\Non him with a Win ticket
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.50,0:02:01.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the payout's\Ngonna be huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.50,0:02:03.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE J] How much\Nwill we get if we kill him?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.82,0:02:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh. You might wanna\Nsit down for this one.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.11,0:02:08.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His bounty is five stars!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.73,0:02:11.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means he's worth\Nfive treasure chests...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.05,0:02:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,500 million berries!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.53,0:02:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captains are usually\Nonly worth one star!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.15,0:02:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must really want\Nthis guy dead, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.56,0:02:21.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE L] Alright,\Nmen! The hunt is on!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.33,0:02:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're about to hit\Nthe jackpot!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.26,0:02:32.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO] I've got an itch\Non the left side of my chest.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.94,0:02:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's where the slaves\Nare held before the sale.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.72,0:02:37.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.12,0:02:44.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO] Are you kitten\Nme? They're escaping!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.42,0:02:46.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The slaves are runnin' for it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.72,0:02:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! That means we\Ncan hunt 'em down! Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.12,0:02:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO] Don't\Neven think ameowt it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.86,0:02:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep your claws in check!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.55,0:02:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring 'em back! Now!\NAnd you better not kill Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.17,0:02:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or I'll make sure you\Nanswer to Teach!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.28,0:03:03.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. Wait, did that\Nrock just talk?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.88,0:03:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY] No. Pizarro\Nknows that we're here!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.66,0:03:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to run!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.63,0:03:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PRISONER C] We're\Nnot gonna make it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.75,0:03:18.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, Koby, you need to get\Nout of here while you still can.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.12,0:03:19.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let us slow you down.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.79,0:03:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I promised that I'd\Nhelp you escape,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.93,0:03:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you will, by\Nusing me as bait!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.68,0:03:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.69,0:03:28.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And no matter what, don't\Nlet the pirates catch you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.93,0:03:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go! I'll see you all again soon!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.57,0:03:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PRISONERS shouting]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.21,0:03:40.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Captain Koby.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.54,0:03:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PRISONER D]\NYou're a living saint!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.73,0:03:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHIRYU] Why\Ndon't you capture
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.99,0:03:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the damned slaves\Nyourself, Pizarro?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.16,0:04:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.08,0:04:06.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,567)}'Cause I don't want Teach\Nto come back and chew meowt.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.37,0:04:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO] Whenever\NI move too much,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.46,0:04:13.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I end up breaking things\Nand it's a huge mess. Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.92,0:04:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VASCO laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.34,0:04:19.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't I stop 'em, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.88,0:04:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Furget it, Vasco.\NWhat are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.02,0:04:30.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,485)}If I set the town on fire,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.64,0:04:33.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,485)}they'll have nowhere\Nto run, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.59,0:04:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO] That would be\Na complete cat-tastrophe!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.26,0:04:48.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare! Teach\Nis gonna be furry-ous!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.88,0:04:51.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VASCO] Eh, what's that?\NBurn 'em, you said?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.36,0:04:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO] Absolutely no\Nburning anyone, you hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.16,0:04:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We just finished\Nrepairing Rocky Port!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.82,0:05:01.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, have it your way.\NWe'll let Wolf handle it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.91,0:05:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO] Wait, Wolf?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.88,0:05:10.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO] That's the worst\Nidea I've ever heard!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.30,0:05:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll crush the whole\Ntown into kitty litter!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.92,0:05:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it, what am I\Nsupposed to do now?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.41,0:05:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES shouting]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.15,0:05:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't keep running\Naway forever!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.20,0:05:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.21,0:05:31.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.26,0:05:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just have to hold out until\Nthe others can get out of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.26,0:05:36.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll figure out\Nthe rest after that!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.38,0:05:39.53,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH] Well, well.\NKoby the Hero!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.83,0:05:42.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.70,0:05:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're here, Koby.\N'Cause I've got big plans.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.47,0:05:52.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn Pirate Island...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.29,0:05:57.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...into a full-fledged country!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.18,0:06:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One that flies the flag\Nof the World Government!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.53,0:06:07.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.23,0:06:07.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that'll make me a king\Nof the Blackbeard Kingdom!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.98,0:06:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.77,0:06:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what d'you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.30,0:06:15.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think your plan's as\Nridiculous as you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.79,0:06:18.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really think the Government\Nwould agree to that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.31,0:06:20.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To a country made\Nup of criminals?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.48,0:06:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't you know it's rude\Nto stomp on someone's dream?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They might see it my way,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.19,0:06:29.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,now I've got you as\Na bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The day the Navy\Nnegotiates with terrorists
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.69,0:06:34.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will be the day justice dies!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.25,0:06:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I won't be your bargaining\Nchip. I can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.01,0:06:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a member of SWORD!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.06,0:06:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? The hell is SWORD?\NNever heard of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.07,0:06:47.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI] So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.89,0:06:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.88,0:06:50.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will not end well.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.60,0:06:53.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Call off the trade,\NTeach. It won't work.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.19,0:06:54.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH] Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.44,0:06:56.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me explain.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.85,0:07:02.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since this kid's from SWORD,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.63,0:07:05.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that means he's a Marine,\Nbut not officially.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.81,0:07:10.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,SWORD members\Nsurrender their Navy Code.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.26,0:07:13.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They aren't like\Ntheir comrades.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.20,0:07:16.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're Marines who have\Nsubmitted their resignations.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.02,0:07:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can pick fights\Nwith the Four Emperors
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.79,0:07:22.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without permission\Nfrom above.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.46,0:07:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can also disregard\Norders at their discretion
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.22,0:07:27.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and move as they like.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.08,0:07:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.51,0:07:27.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's the issue.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.43,0:07:31.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy is absolved\Nof all responsibility
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.64,0:07:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for their actions.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.61,0:07:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can cut them\Nloose as they see fit.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.14,0:07:37.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.06,0:07:39.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH] Ain't that cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.77,0:07:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Most Marines just\Nsit on their asses,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.82,0:07:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,waiting for daddy's\Npermission to fight us.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.36,0:07:47.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you do what you like,\Nconsequences be damned!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.65,0:07:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.88,0:07:53.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it now! I like your style!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.82,0:07:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That said, I'm not gonna\Nchange my plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.58,0:08:00.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause you're a special case!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.09,0:08:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter if you're\Nwith SWORD or not.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.35,0:08:07.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The public won't like it if\Nthe Navy abandons you.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.94,0:08:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's bad press to turn\Nyour back on a hero, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.76,0:08:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your life's\Nin the people's hands.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.04,0:08:16.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like the World\NGovernment
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.42,0:08:19.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will lose credibility either way!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.22,0:08:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.57,0:08:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think he gets the message.\NWe're done here.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.21,0:08:30.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lock him up and don't\Nlet him escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.29,0:08:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE R] Get\Nback here, Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.39,0:08:35.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PERONA laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.24,0:08:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.38,0:08:51.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps] [KOBY] Guess this is what I\Ndeserve for helping a pirate!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But necessity knows no law!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.97,0:09:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE S] The hell's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.27,0:09:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.69,0:09:16.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE T] Three Marines\Njust showed up at the port!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.03,0:09:18.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Marines? That can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.75,0:09:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE U] Hurry up!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.61,0:09:23.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE V] They're\Nstrong! Be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE U, PIRATE T yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.71,0:09:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY] Did someone\Ncome to rescue me?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.55,0:09:30.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,No, stop it, Koby, this is\Nnot the time for your selfishness!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.85,0:09:33.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.27,0:09:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE GOLEM A yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.11,0:09:39.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE W yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.08,0:09:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.95,0:09:51.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.04,0:09:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AB] Who are\Nthey? They're monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.00,0:09:54.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AC] Looks\Nlike they're headed
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.00,0:09:56.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,straight to the center of town!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.47,0:09:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do they want from us?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.92,0:10:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know! Just shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.77,0:10:10.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? They didn't even flinch!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.27,0:10:10.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AD yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.59,0:10:13.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AD] End\Nof the line, monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.02,0:10:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.19,0:10:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AE] Whoa!\NHis head came off!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.32,0:10:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AD] Woohoo! Y'see\Nthat? That's how it's done!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.73,0:10:27.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not so tough now!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.41,0:10:31.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AE] Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.17,0:10:34.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE GOLEM A] That hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.84,0:10:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? He's a logia-type!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.51,0:10:39.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AD] What the hell\Nis wrong with him?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.55,0:10:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His body's like clay!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.33,0:10:44.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE F] Where\Nare you, Koby?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.21,0:10:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.20,0:10:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear I just saw those\Nbuildings move on their own!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.90,0:10:53.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure they did, pal!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.65,0:10:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's quitting\Ndrinking going for ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.87,0:10:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE G laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.78,0:11:01.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.74,0:11:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUJAKU] Be good\Nand do as I say!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.44,0:11:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now march forward!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.42,0:11:13.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is she whipping that\Nbuilding? That's weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.30,0:11:16.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on. Where's\Nyour stamina?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.10,0:11:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.28,0:11:22.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUJAKU] Is that really the best\Nyou can do? You are so pathetic!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.11,0:11:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AJ] I kinda feel like\Nwe shouldn't be watching this.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.37,0:11:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hi, boys. Finished staring?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.60,0:11:32.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh! We, uh...\NWait, that mark!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.96,0:11:43.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You pirates act like you've\Nnever seen a Marine before.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.12,0:11:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUJAKU] How adorable.\NCome here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.83,0:11:59.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.98,0:12:01.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.13,0:12:11.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY] What now?\NI'm done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.46,0:12:15.97,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.38,0:12:18.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AL] Eyes\Non the target, boys!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.99,0:12:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready. Aim. Fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.17,0:12:40.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.10,0:08:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.51,0:08:45.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll unlock this door\Nfor you, and in return,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.22,0:08:49.56,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(5816,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}you'll free Master Moria\Nfrom his cell, deeper inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.34,0:12:49.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE C] What? What?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.51,0:12:51.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.81,0:12:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! How lovely!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.73,0:12:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, no! What is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.93,0:13:01.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are these goddamn\Nflowers coming from?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.55,0:13:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[growls] Wait, I've seen this.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.94,0:13:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.32,0:13:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE D] Dr.\NVegapunk invented this!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.51,0:13:15.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[applause]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.66,0:13:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE D] In fact, it earned\Nhim the Mobel Peace Prize!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.97,0:13:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody cares\Nabout that, okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.40,0:13:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell did\Nthis to our guns?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.14,0:13:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koby!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HIBARI] Come here\Nand stay close to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.46,0:13:34.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. Uh.\NBut not in a weird way!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.50,0:13:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hibari? What are you\Ndoing here? Are those...?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.00,0:13:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. They're\NFlower Rounds.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.04,0:13:47.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they won't last;\Nwe have to hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.71,0:13:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to go before\Nthe enemy's gunpowder
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.83,0:13:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,stops turning into flowers!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.49,0:13:54.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also... I, uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.72,0:13:57.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want\Nyour food to get cold!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.00,0:14:01.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I... I...\NI packed you a lunch!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.18,0:14:02.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY] Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.06,0:14:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,107)}[HIBARI] Ah! No, I misspoke!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,107)}I mean, you misheard me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.51,0:14:10.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A ringing]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.48,0:14:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TASHIGI] Prince!\NWhat's the status?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.31,0:14:15.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GRUS] We're in the clear.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.82,0:14:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything went\Noff without a hitch.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.43,0:14:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2}Koby's doing fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.74,0:14:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec. This place\Ndoesn't look right.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.42,0:14:34.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.29,0:14:36.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.29,0:14:40.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Everyone, look!\NThat building just moved!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.25,0:14:42.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE G] No! Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.39,0:14:46.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.89,0:14:48.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] They moved the buildings\Nand trapped us here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.36,0:14:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just got confirmation\Nfrom Prince!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.87,0:14:59.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone is in position!\NWe're ready, Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.47,0:14:59.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.74,0:15:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Hang on tight!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.61,0:15:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To hell we go!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.34,0:15:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GARP laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.60,0:15:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! If you're\Nready, I am, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES murmuring]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE I] Whoa,\Nwhat the hell is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.77,0:15:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE G] I'm not stickin'\Naround to find out!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.24,0:15:35.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps, yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.54,0:15:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.20,0:15:43.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's flying straight for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.22,0:15:46.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE L] But why?\NAnd how?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.29,0:15:48.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE M] Whose\Nship is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.40,0:15:51.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh... Looks like it's falling.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.99,0:15:55.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE O] We\Ngotta go! Run away!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.50,0:16:01.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE P] No way!\NI know that ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.36,0:16:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE Q] No. That can't be\Nright! I thought he retired!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.02,0:16:11.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE R] The legendary\Nhero! He's coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.06,0:16:16.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GARP laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.08,0:16:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE S] It's\NVice Admiral Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.33,0:16:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby! I came to get ya, boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.98,0:16:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on! We have\Nto take cover!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.48,0:16:31.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're trapped! There's\Nno way outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.86,0:16:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! You wanna\Npiece of me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.65,0:16:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(580,1053)}– [PIRATE W] Uh! Oh, shit!\N– He's coming for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.63,0:16:59.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not worth any of this!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.77,0:17:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You would risk starting\Na war just to protect me?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.33,0:17:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, morons!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.53,0:17:13.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you kidnapped?\NDo you know who that kid is?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.57,0:17:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.51,0:17:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GARP] Koby's not just\Nthe future of the Navy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.38,0:17:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That boy...\Nis my favorite student!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.72,0:19:11.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My back! Damn\NGarp! He's insane!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.11,0:19:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd ya go? You're dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.24,0:19:16.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, pirates! Not so fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.13,0:19:19.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HELMEPPO] We've got\Nplenty more firepower.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.42,0:19:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GARP] Still a few\Nbuildings left.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.21,0:19:33.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must be losin' my touch.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.03,0:19:34.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Losing your touch"?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.63,0:19:37.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AB] Quit rubbin'\Nit in, you old bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.49,0:19:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY] Vice Admiral Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.85,0:19:43.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey! There he is!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.39,0:19:48.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.49,0:19:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought my buddy\Nwas gonna die!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.57,0:19:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And once again, Garp overdid it.\NSuch a naughty boy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.28,0:20:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he said Koby\Nis the future of the Navy.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.56,0:20:03.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As if. I'll put that\Nkid in his place!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.72,0:20:06.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUJAKU] I know you're\Ntoo spoiled to know better,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.07,0:20:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that's not the sort of thing\Nyou should say out loud.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.26,0:20:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What have you got\Nthere? A big ball and chain?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.83,0:20:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We had no choice\Nbut to take it with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's frozen solid?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.29,0:20:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.63,0:21:08.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, Kuzan? Why\Nare you doing this?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.72,0:21:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfreeze Hibari right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.46,0:21:14.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE AC] Woohoo!\NHell yeah, it's Aokiji!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.18,0:21:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are dead now!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.58,0:21:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI] Don't get\Nme in trouble, kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.52,0:21:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't have you getting away.\NHow would that look to Teach?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.62,0:21:29.59,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] Two years ago,\Nthere was a struggle
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.59,0:21:31.80,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,to determine who would be\Nthe next Fleet Admiral
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.80,0:21:33.51,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,at Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.03,0:21:40.17,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,To that end, Admiral Akainu\Nand Admiral Aokiji had a duel.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.06,0:21:46.79,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] The fight\Nwent on for ten days
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.87,0:21:49.26,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,before a victor was decided.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.07,0:21:55.03,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Regardless, Aokiji\Nrefused to serve
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.03,0:22:01.54,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,under Akainu as Fleet Admiral,\Nand so, he resigned.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.42,0:22:20.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.50,0:22:23.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON A]\NBlackbeard is here!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.75,0:22:26.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON B] Run!\NGet outta town while you can!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.05,0:22:29.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What is this?\NWhat happened here?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.34,0:22:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Someone tell\Nme who did this!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.56,0:22:40.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH] Wait,\NI know what this is.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.69,0:22:42.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't even gotta ask.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.03,0:22:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's only one guy in the world\Nwho could pull this off!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.82,0:22:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought so! Aokiji!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.36,0:23:06.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH] What's the big idea,\Nturnin' my crew into ice cubes?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.40,0:23:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fix it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.51,0:23:11.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI] Why don't\Nyou fix your attitude?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.02,0:23:15.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI] Wouldn't do\Nthat if I were you.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.47,0:23:19.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your friends'll shatter and die.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.93,0:23:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, now. You think\NI started this fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.37,0:23:28.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what kinad\Ncompany you keep.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.22,0:23:32.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, I'm sure you heard\Nthe news about me.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.65,0:23:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm in a state of mourning.\NYou shouldn't test me.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.63,0:23:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So let's cool it\Nwith the demands, shall we?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.08,0:24:15.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not so bad\Nyourself, shitbag!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.42,0:24:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH, AOKIJI laugh]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.21,0:24:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, before the battle,\Nwhat does Akainu say?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.70,0:24:27.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"We climbed the ranks together,\Nnow we fight to the death.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.21,0:24:31.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel a hot\Nlump in my throat."
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.37,0:24:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what he said.\NAnd you know what I told him?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.17,0:24:37.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"No shit, asshole,\Nyou're made of magma!"
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.10,0:24:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIZARRO laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.47,0:24:42.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look what that bastard did!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.15,0:24:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Took off my whole damn leg!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.93,0:24:49.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's what happens\Nwhen two admirals
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.97,0:24:51.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,decide to throw down, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.43,0:24:56.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So'd you pay him back, or what?\NRip off one of his arms, maybe?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.09,0:24:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI] Nah.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.71,0:25:02.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he's got some scars\Nto remember me by.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.30,0:25:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] That reminds\Nme, Commodore.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.49,0:25:09.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He might know the Man\Nwith the Burn Scar.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.99,0:25:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The what? Who\Nthe hell's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.24,0:25:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For real? So you\Nhaven't heard?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.16,0:25:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deal is, if we wanna\Nmake it to Laugh Tale,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.41,0:25:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta find the four\NRoad Poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.09,0:25:22.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ys know 'em when you see 'em,\N'cause they're bright red.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.82,0:25:25.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido and Big Mom\Nhave one each.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.27,0:25:30.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what about the other two?\NThey're still a mystery!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.71,0:25:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're just hoping fate\Nwill guide us to them.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.37,0:25:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.54,0:25:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we do have\None tiny lead.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.90,0:25:40.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We heard some man with a burn\Nscar has one of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.37,0:25:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.50,0:25:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, not you! You just\Ngot that the other day!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.85,0:25:48.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VASCO laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.02,0:25:53.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] Quite\Nthe mystery, no?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.41,0:26:00.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAFITTE] Rumor has it that\Nthe Man with the Burn Scar
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.92,0:26:03.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sails on a pitch-black ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.34,0:26:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.30,0:26:12.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAFITTE] But if\Nanyone approaches it,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.30,0:26:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,their ship will be\Nwhisked away,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.31,0:26:18.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,swallowed up by\Na giant whirlpool.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.93,0:26:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd assume the fellow\Nhas a devil fruit power.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.31,0:26:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHIRYU] Just a hunch,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.45,0:26:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I bet the guy is\Nwith the Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.39,0:26:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've got their hands\Nin everything,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.74,0:26:32.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and plenty of dark secrets.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.24,0:26:34.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They know everyone\Nneeds those stones.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.90,0:26:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they had one, all they'd\Nhave to do is hold on to it...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.99,0:26:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and we'd be sunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.58,0:26:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No pirate could find their way\Nto Laugh Tale or the One Piece.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.72,0:26:48.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Poneglyphs, huh?\NBrings back memories.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.30,0:26:49.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to ya,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.57,0:26:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I never saw a giant\Nred stone in Ohara.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.97,0:26:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd remember.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.54,0:26:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten\Na thing about that day.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.46,0:27:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The day I watched my best friend\Nrebel against the Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.89,0:27:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the day that I\Nsaw those sad eyes.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.46,0:27:08.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I held that poor,\Nlonely girl's fate in my hands.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.89,0:27:13.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? That story sounds\Nboring as all hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.46,0:27:16.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.40,0:27:19.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAFITTE] Commodore,\Nwhat should we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.71,0:27:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A power like his could be\Nquite useful.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.98,0:27:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I say we take it while\Nhis guard's down.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.08,0:27:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.62,0:27:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI] I heard that,\Nyou conniving bastards!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.62,0:27:35.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.96,0:27:39.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna know what it\Nfeels like to freeze to death?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.76,0:27:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAFITTE gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.47,0:27:47.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI] So\Nthe rumors are true.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.20,0:27:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're hunting people
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.20,0:27:51.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with strong devil fruit\Npowers, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.62,0:27:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then try to take\Nmine! I dare you!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.37,0:28:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.46,0:28:05.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My crew members were\Ngetting carried away, that's all!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.38,0:28:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me apologize\Non their behalf.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.92,0:28:11.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna\Nsteal your power.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.47,0:28:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to join my crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.62,0:28:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.51,0:28:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? An ex-Marine?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.72,0:28:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why not? You're out\Nof a job now, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.77,0:28:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got any place to go?\NAnything you're planning to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.54,0:28:27.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not gonna be defending\Njustice anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.25,0:28:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! Guess I've sunk\Npretty low, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.26,0:28:31.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A good-for-nothing\Npirate's worried about
Dialogue: 50,0:28:31.99,0:28:33.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the state of my employment.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:34.19,0:28:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH] Men like us will find\Ntrouble anywhere we go.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.86,0:28:40.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't run, so you might\Nas well face it head-on.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.23,0:28:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What flag will you fly?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.93,0:28:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you put\Nyour life on the line,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.06,0:28:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what will you be fighting for?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.14,0:28:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:49.13,0:28:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got my own brand\Nof justice, my own code!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.10,0:28:55.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This won't be nothing like\Nthe Navy, I promise you!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.09,0:28:56.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.18,0:28:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'll still get stabbed\Nstraight in the back!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.22,0:29:01.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think sharin' a couple\Nof drinks means I can trust you?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.38,0:29:02.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.64,0:29:05.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think you understand\Nhow pirates work!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.50,0:29:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not here\Nto make friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.37,0:29:09.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're a crew, but we're\Nnot buddy-buddy!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.53,0:29:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.75,0:29:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We all have a common goal!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.95,0:29:23.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH] All pirates need is\Nan alignment of interests!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.06,0:29:30.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're free now,\NKuzan. Your choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.24,0:29:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you really want?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.83,0:29:52.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop this, Kuzan!\NThaw Hibari out right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.12,0:29:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let Koby escape from here!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.16,0:29:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back to the Navy!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.78,0:29:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.24,0:30:02.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'never change, huh?\NCan't stop to think.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.61,0:30:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just run your mouth.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.41,0:30:11.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I can't\Nhelp you today, Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.09,0:30:17.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI] You've always been\Nstraightforward. I admire that.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.33,0:30:18.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You inspired me.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.39,0:30:21.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm livin' the way\NI want to now!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.62,0:30:28.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damn fool.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.87,0:30:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:30:46.12,0:30:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Ice Ball!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.26,0:30:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOBY] Vice Admiral Garp!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:56.61,0:30:58.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheer]
Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.61,0:30:59.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.30,0:31:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AOKIJI] Your old student\Nand your new student...
Dialogue: 50,0:31:07.77,0:31:11.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you do anything to save\NKoby, even if it kills me?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:11.71,0:31:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh. What are you doing,\Nbringing up the past?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.10,0:31:19.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I taught you to live\Nin the moment, didn't I?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:22.07,0:31:24.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.68,0:31:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell did\Nhe break free?!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:47.58,0:31:48.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's another lesson!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:12.51,0:32:14.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Men who waver...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:16.51,0:32:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...are weak!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.36,0:32:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Come on! Blue Hole!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:32.57,0:33:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that your ship\Nis out of the picture,
Dialogue: 50,0:33:34.57,0:33:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you haven't just lost your right\Nto call yourself a pirate,
Dialogue: 50,0:33:38.03,0:33:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you've lost your only escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:41.24,0:33:44.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You stole 100 hearts\Nthat day at Rocky Port.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:44.20,0:33:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You had to expect some\Nkinda payback from me!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:47.42,0:33:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those poor pirates\Nback at my base,
Dialogue: 50,0:33:49.38,0:33:52.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,living every damn day in fear!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:52.38,0:33:55.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I think I'll bring them\Nback your heart as a gift!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:55.30,0:33:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bet that'll have the sad\Nbastards jumpin' for joy!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:58.85,0:34:01.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TEACH laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:34:05.67,0:34:07.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, you\Nmade this for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:07.88,0:34:09.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3479,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}But I haven't been\Nable to test it,
Dialogue: 50,0:34:09.46,0:34:12.09,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3479,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}so I can't guarantee it'll work.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:17.68,0:34:19.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:19.17,0:34:20.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We could sell your Fruit,
Dialogue: 50,0:34:20.38,0:34:23.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I think I could put\Nit to better use.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:23.38,0:34:27.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say it can grant\Nsomeone eternal life, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:27.66,0:34:32.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL chuckling]
Dialogue: 50,0:34:24.73,0:34:27.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:34:32.87,0:34:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO] You... stay away!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:39.52,0:34:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO] That's my captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:49.13,0:34:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAW] Bepo.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:56.14,0:35:01.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be! Sulong? But how?\NThe moon isn't even out!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:06.36,0:35:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:35:12.12,0:35:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BURGESS, DOC Q scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:35:18.63,0:35:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:35:19.67,0:35:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:35:52.61,0:35:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! They're\Nheaded to the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:55.55,0:35:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get them, now!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:02.30,0:36:06.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LAW] Take me back, Bepo.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:11.60,0:36:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're my friends.\NI can't leave them.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:15.82,0:36:19.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Captain!\NWe can't risk it!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:19.68,0:36:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But your crew was forged\Nin the cold waters of the north!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:26.47,0:36:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have faith in them!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:27.77,0:36:31.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Through every fight,\Nthey've held strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:31.89,0:36:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They won't die here!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:40.01,0:36:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO] We've overcome\Nso much together!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:44.25,0:36:49.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO] We have\Nto survive! All of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:58.97,0:37:03.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEPO] Don't die,\NCaptain! We need you!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:07.98,0:37:11.57,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] The battle at Winner\NIsland, in the New World,
Dialogue: 50,0:37:11.57,0:37:13.99,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,came to an end.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:19.93,0:37:22.80,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] Blackbeard\Ndestroyed the Polar Tang,
Dialogue: 50,0:37:22.80,0:37:25.68,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the submarine\Nof the Heart Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:37:26.95,0:37:29.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and it sank into the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:31.61,0:37:38.05,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Heart Pirates, led by\NTrafalgar Law, were defeated.
